WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,960
You didn't say it at first

2
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:02,200
There are also team formation and hard work fees

3
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:03,560
And your armor isn't broken either.

4
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:06,600
I think we should re-discuss the distribution of bonuses, silly boy.

5
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:07,920
Are you still trying to reason with people?

6
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:09,960
Those people are obviously a group of little girls

7
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:10,880
You don't seem to understand

8
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:11,920
because of us

9
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:13,200
You can participate in this game

10
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,600
If we don't team up with you

11
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:16,360
You can't even get through the arena gate.

12
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:19,080
That's why we should discuss it carefully.

13
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:20,440
It’s the first time I’m not familiar with it

14
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:21,920
I have no objection to the distribution today.

15
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:23,120
But the next game

16
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:24,120
I think we should develop

17
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:25,040
More detailed planning

18
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:29,250
The next game

19
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:32,050
Let's do it when you're ready, little girl. The next game is your Bounty Skills Tournament.

20
00:00:32,050 --> 00:00:33,450
Anyone aged 18 or above can participate

21
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:36,170
Yes, you can participate if you are over 18 years old. But why should we

22
00:00:36,170 --> 00:00:37,730
I have to team up with an eighteen-year-old like you

23
00:00:37,730 --> 00:00:40,050
Other teams are composed of retired fighters or more advanced

24
00:00:40,050 --> 00:00:41,330
People with technical skills and practical experience
